  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Society - Institutional Capacity Building in Water management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project proposed to build capacity among institutions of higer education and individuals therein charged with building local capacity for water, society and climate change management in Sri Lanka, Bangladesh and Cambodia.</narrative>
  </description>
